  "props_doc": "X.set_function_expression_property(function_path, expression_id, property_name, property_value) -> bool\r\nSet a property on an expression inside a Material Function's graph.\nMaps to action=\"set_function_expression_property\"\n\nLike SetExpressionProperty but operates on a UMaterialFunction.\r\n\r\nArgs:\r\n    function_path (str): Full asset path to the UMaterialFunction\r\n    expression_id (str): Expression ID\r\n    property_name (str): Property name\r\n    property_value (str): Value as string\r\n\r\nReturns:\r\n    bool: True if successful"
